# Event photographs (public/events/). Most show children, and this repository
# is PUBLIC, so committing a file publishes it. A photograph is kept out of git
# until guardian consent is recorded for it in src/content/seed/event-photos.ts.
# Ignore the CONTENTS (`/*`), not the directory: git cannot re-include a file
# whose parent directory is ignored. Once consent is recorded, un-ignore that
# one file by adding, on the line below:
#   !public/events/img_0707.jpg
public/events/*
